# Line-ending policy.
#
# The translation dictionaries and spot patches match literal source content
# byte-for-byte, including CRLF sequences inside multi-line template literals
# (26 dictionary keys, 4 raw patches and 1 keep entry depend on it). Pin JS/CSS
# checkouts to CRLF on every platform so Windows builds and Linux CI produce
# the exact same translated artifact. Git still stores LF in the repository.
#
# Markdown is pinned to LF so packaged READMEs/skills are byte-identical on
# every platform as well.
*.js  text eol=crlf
*.css text eol=crlf
*.md  text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
